  "scientific_caveats": [
    "These CV metrics measure out-of-fold performance of a predictor that combines fold-isolated discovered rules with learned linear/logistic fallback.",
    "The Brier score should be compared to the base-rate Brier. A value above the base rate indicates poor probability calibration despite good discrimination.",
